{"title": "Melee Weapon Trader Table", "pageid": 16261, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Melee_Weapon_Trader_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Vendor tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Melee Weapon Trader Table</b>, also known as <code>EquipmentTrader_Melee</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_Melee+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_Melee+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Melee_weapons\" title=\"Category:Melee weapons\">melee weapons</a>. It includes the <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Magic_Melee_Weapon_Trader_table&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Magic Melee Weapon Trader table (page does not exist)\">Magic Melee Weapon Trader table</a>, which is displayed combined for brevity.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_table\">Drop table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{#lst:Melee Weapon Trader Table|table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Melee_Weapon_Subtable\" title=\"Martial Melee Weapon Subtable\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/60px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Melee_Weapon_Subtable\" title=\"Martial Melee Weapon Subtable\">Martial Melee Weapon Subtable</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">4</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr> \n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Simple_Melee_Weapon_Subtable\" title=\"Simple Melee Weapon Subtable\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/60px-Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Simple_Melee_Weapon_Subtable\" title=\"Simple Melee Weapon Subtable\">Simple Melee Weapon Subtable</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">3</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr> \n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Simple_Melee_Weapon_Subtable_%2B1\" title=\"Simple Melee Weapon Subtable +1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/60px-Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Simple_Melee_Weapon_Subtable_%2B1\" title=\"Simple Melee Weapon Subtable +1\">Simple Melee Weapon Subtable +1</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">2</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Melee_Weapon_Subtable_%2B1\" title=\"Martial Melee Weapon Subtable +1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/60px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Melee_Weapon_Subtable_%2B1\" title=\"Martial Melee Weapon Subtable +1\">Martial Melee Weapon Subtable +1</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">2</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Traders\">Traders</span></h2>\n<i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{#lst:Melee Weapon Trader Table|traders}}</code>.</i> <i>It is a list of traders which use this table.</i><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dammon\" title=\"Dammon\">Dammon</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\">Roah Moonglow</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/A%27jak%27nir_Jeera\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A'jak'nir Jeera\">A'jak'nir Jeera</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek\" title=\"Crèche Y'llek\">Crèche Y'llek</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714233350\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1858/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19651/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4099/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 18/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1080271/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!